{'symbol': 'KMB', 'date': '2022-01-13 10:00:00', 'title': 'KIMBERLY-CLARK ANNOUNCES SCHEDULE FOR FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2021 FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': "DALLAS, JAN. 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KIMBERLY-CLARK CORPORATION (NYSE: KMB) WILL ISSUE ITS FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2021 RESULTS ON WEDNESDAY, JANUARY 26 WITH A NEWS RELEASE ISSUED VIA PR NEWSWIRE AND FIRST CALL AT APPROXIMATELY 6:30 A.M. CST. IN ADDITION TO THE NEWS RELEASE, THE COMPANY WILL MAKE AVAILABLE PREPARED MANAGEMENT REMARKS FROM KIMBERLY-CLARK'S CHAIRMAN AND CEO MIKE HSU AND CFO MARIA HENRY AT APPROXIMATELY 7 A.M."}